    e "Esos son solo rumores, Antonio. No hay ninguna prueba de que Catalina tenga algo que ver con los incidentes."

# game/act2.rpy:479
translate spanish paddock1_topic2_9a9e97e3:

    # r "Hmph. Believe what you want. I wouldn't get anywhere near that woman if I were you."
