    tt aw neutral drop "No puedo decir que me haga mucha gracia que me traten como si fuera un simple reemplazo desechable."

# game/act2.rpy:488
translate spanish paddock1_topic2_cce46288:

    # tt neutral drop "Still, that's not what I came here for. As long as she leaves me to my own devices, this arrangement works in my favor."
    tt neutral drop "Igual, no vine para eso. Mientras me deje hacer lo mío, este arreglo me conviene."

# game/act2.rpy:490
translate spanish paddock1_complete_2b673a2d:

    # e "Oh, look at the time. We'd better wrap things up here, Renata."
    e "Uy, mirá la hora. Más vale que vamos terminando con esto, Renata."

# game/act2.rpy:494
translate spanish paddock1_complete_6e6efa9e:

    # r "Yeah, yeah. The old geezers have had a good look at who's gonna leave everyone else in the dust by now."
