# game/act2.rpy:520
translate spanish paddock1_complete_082531d1:

    # tt neutral right "The two of them went back to resume the parade. Sponsors, huh...? Must be some kind of contractual obligation. I wonder how many other jockeys have to put up with that."
    tt neutral right "Los dos volvieron para retomar el desfile. Patrocinadores, ¿eh...? Debe ser alguna obligación contractual. Me pregunto cuántos otros jinetes tendrán que bancarse eso."

# game/act2.rpy:522
translate spanish paddock1_complete_75ab149a:

